1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 42]</font>

15
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

16
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

17
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

18
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:21,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun!</font>

19
00:01:21,360 --> 00:01:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan!</font>

20
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

21
00:01:26,360 --> 00:01:26,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun!</font>

22
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

23
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't go on.</font>

24
00:01:34,080 --> 00:01:35,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've searched
the cliff base and the valley,</font>

25
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but there's no sign of Qinglan.</font>

26
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun,</font>

27
00:01:39,960 --> 00:01:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where are you?</font>

28
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

29
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No news right now</font>

30
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is the best news.</font>

31
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:46,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But</font>

32
00:01:47,320 --> 00:01:49,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's already been three days.</font>

33
00:01:49,680 --> 00:01:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's nothing here but Yaoji</font>

34
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a few bodies.</font>

35
00:01:54,960 --> 00:01:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just feel Li Congyao isn't himself.</font>

36
00:01:56,920 --> 00:01:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He won't eat or sleep,</font>

37
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and he insists on leaving
the bodies exposed</font>

38
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for the wolves to feast on.</font>

39
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why pick a fight with the dead?</font>

40
00:02:04,360 --> 00:02:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let him be.</font>

41
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:06,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is the only way</font>

42
00:02:06,840 --> 00:02:08,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to vent the fury in his heart.</font>

43
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:09,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

44
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm worried he can't go on like this.</font>

45
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His health might fail</font>

46
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before we find Qinglan.</font>

47
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Unless we find Wei,</font>

48
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no one can talk him down.</font>

49
00:02:21,280 --> 00:02:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Heavens above,</font>

50
00:02:22,840 --> 00:02:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bless Jun and Prince Duan.</font>

51
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They've endured so much.</font>

52
00:02:25,760 --> 00:02:27,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please keep mother and child safe.</font>

53
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let them reunite soon.</font>

54
00:02:29,600 --> 00:02:30,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg of you.</font>

55
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:52,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei,</font>

56
00:02:57,120 --> 00:02:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will surely find you.</font>

57
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:13,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss.</font>

58
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're awake.</font>

59
00:03:18,640 --> 00:03:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you remember me?</font>

60
00:03:23,040 --> 00:03:23,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My benefactor.</font>

61
00:03:23,720 --> 00:03:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're finally awake.</font>

62
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been out for three days.</font>

63
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

64
00:03:32,400 --> 00:03:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gouzi, up now.</font>

65
00:03:34,160 --> 00:03:34,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

66
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have some water first.</font>

67
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where am I?</font>

68
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is Jifu Village.</font>

69
00:03:51,160 --> 00:03:52,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My home.</font>

70
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The physician says you're with child.</font>

71
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:56,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't move. Rest properly.</font>

72
00:03:59,600 --> 00:04:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The baby is safe?</font>

73
00:04:01,840 --> 00:04:02,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You fell</font>

74
00:04:02,920 --> 00:04:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from such a high cliff.</font>

75
00:04:05,560 --> 00:04:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's a blessing you landed
in the branches.</font>

76
00:04:08,160 --> 00:04:09,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your sash got tangled up.</font>

77
00:04:10,080 --> 00:04:11,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's what saved the child.</font>

78
00:04:12,080 --> 00:04:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You truly have a charmed life.</font>

79
00:04:16,280 --> 00:04:16,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Madam,</font>

80
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must leave at once.</font>

81
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:19,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My child's father is waiting for me.</font>

82
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:21,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no. Lie down.</font>

83
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The physician said
the baby's position is off.</font>

84
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need proper rest for a while.</font>

85
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stay here with me for now.</font>

86
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Send word to your family
that you're safe.</font>

87
00:04:31,360 --> 00:04:32,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have your husband come fetch you.</font>

88
00:04:33,200 --> 00:04:35,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The baby's well-being comes first.</font>

89
00:04:37,880 --> 00:04:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll stay here</font>

90
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for a while.</font>

91
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:43,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thank you for saving my life.</font>

92
00:04:43,960 --> 00:04:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Think nothing of it.</font>

93
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:48,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You helped me
at the post station before.</font>

94
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are both mothers,</font>

95
00:04:50,520 --> 00:04:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just helping each other out.</font>

96
00:05:01,880 --> 00:05:03,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry, go hide now!</font>

97
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll count to ten and come find you.</font>

98
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One.</font>

99
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:10,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Two.</font>

100
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Three.</font>

101
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Four.</font>

102
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five.</font>

103
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:18,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Six.</font>

104
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:19,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seven.</font>

105
00:05:20,480 --> 00:05:21,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eight.</font>

106
00:05:21,880 --> 00:05:22,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nine.</font>

107
00:05:23,400 --> 00:05:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ten.</font>

108
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm coming to get you!</font>

109
00:05:43,160 --> 00:05:43,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got you!</font>

110
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I got you!</font>

111
00:05:50,280 --> 00:05:51,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You were caught so fast.</font>

112
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss.</font>

113
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:57,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you homesick?</font>

114
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:01,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've lived here for so long,</font>

115
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the messenger left days ago.</font>

116
00:06:05,880 --> 00:06:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But still no word has come.</font>

117
00:06:15,840 --> 00:06:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss.</font>

118
00:06:17,480 --> 00:06:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't miss home.</font>

119
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:19,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will keep you company.</font>

120
00:06:23,160 --> 00:06:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With you by my side,</font>

121
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't miss home.</font>

122
00:06:27,680 --> 00:06:28,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Li.</font>

123
00:06:28,760 --> 00:06:29,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mrs. Li.</font>

124
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something awful has happened.</font>

125
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must come and see at once.</font>

126
00:06:33,320 --> 00:06:33,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

127
00:06:34,400 --> 00:06:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry.</font>

128
00:06:42,280 --> 00:06:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The body lies face up.</font>

129
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Head to the east, feet to the west.</font>

130
00:06:45,160 --> 00:06:46,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Facing toward the courtyard.</font>

131
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mouth slightly open,
limbs partially stiff.</font>

132
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Body rigid, no visible wounds.</font>

133
00:06:52,440 --> 00:06:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Judging by the scene,</font>

134
00:06:53,520 --> 00:06:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there are clear signs of a struggle.</font>

135
00:06:57,040 --> 00:06:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone, look.</font>

136
00:06:57,880 --> 00:06:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even Mrs. Li has said it.</font>

137
00:06:59,280 --> 00:06:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our family's chicken</font>

138
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was clearly strangled by him.</font>

139
00:07:02,080 --> 00:07:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

140
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't make false accusations.</font>

141
00:07:04,120 --> 00:07:05,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just thought it was too noisy,</font>

142
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I threw a stone into the yard.</font>

143
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only meant to scare it.</font>

144
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When did I kill your chicken?</font>

145
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't deny it. You strangled it.</font>

146
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Welcome.</font>

147
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You must be tired.</font>

148
00:07:19,240 --> 00:07:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please come inside.</font>

149
00:07:20,520 --> 00:07:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's the argument over there about?</font>

150
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The chicken</font>

151
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was killed by a village troublemaker.</font>

152
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, the manager</font>

153
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:27,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">got a female coroner to solve it.</font>

154
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They're arguing about it now.</font>

155
00:07:29,120 --> 00:07:29,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A female coroner?</font>

156
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:36,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Enough arguing.</font>

157
00:07:37,120 --> 00:07:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know how this chicken died.</font>

158
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:41,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Cloudy eyes, rigor mortis.</font>

159
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Preliminary time of death:
Six hours ago.</font>

160
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was before dawn.</font>

161
00:07:47,240 --> 00:07:49,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It doesn't match the time
the manager claimed.</font>

162
00:07:49,800 --> 00:07:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I remember correctly,</font>

163
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the wind blew all night long.</font>

164
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:54,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This chicken</font>

165
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:58,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must have been left out of the cage
and froze.</font>

166
00:07:59,080 --> 00:08:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Case solved!</font>

167
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was all just a misunderstanding.</font>

168
00:08:02,560 --> 00:08:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This female coroner is impressive.</font>

169
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:05,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why didn't you lock the chicken
in its cage?</font>

170
00:08:05,440 --> 00:08:06,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Manager, don't be upset.</font>

171
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:09,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A chicken that froze to death
hasn't spoiled.</font>

172
00:08:09,760 --> 00:08:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In fact, it stays quite fresh.</font>

173
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:12,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It can still be cooked into a dish.</font>

174
00:08:23,600 --> 00:08:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei!</font>

175
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

176
00:08:28,770 --> 00:08:30,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

177
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

178
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

179
00:08:34,360 --> 00:08:38,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

180
00:08:39,040 --> 00:08:42,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

181
00:08:43,020 --> 00:08:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪From now on, the sky is full of stars♪</font>

182
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It really is you.</font>

183
00:08:49,800 --> 00:08:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You finally came.</font>

184
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:53,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No more words are needed♪</font>

185
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I knew</font>

186
00:08:54,760 --> 00:08:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you wouldn't leave me so easily.</font>

187
00:09:00,600 --> 00:09:01,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gently.</font>

188
00:09:01,400 --> 00:09:04,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

189
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't press on our child.</font>

190
00:09:08,740 --> 00:09:13,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

191
00:09:13,280 --> 00:09:16,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

192
00:09:17,260 --> 00:09:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

193
00:09:20,360 --> 00:09:23,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Crown Prince's Residence]</font>

194
00:09:27,400 --> 00:09:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, Ying.</font>

195
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My sister loves meat.</font>

196
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">More vegetables are good for her.</font>

197
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:36,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The veggies Mobai serves
must be delicious.</font>

198
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is indeed delicious.</font>

199
00:09:42,320 --> 00:09:42,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

200
00:09:43,200 --> 00:09:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We rode there at full speed</font>

201
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:46,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to bring Jun back for prenatal care.</font>

202
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Li Congyao</font>

203
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">keeps dragging Jun out for fun.</font>

204
00:09:50,800 --> 00:09:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm so furious.</font>

205
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">These past two days,</font>

206
00:09:52,520 --> 00:09:54,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've lost my appetite and weight.</font>

207
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:56,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then eat more</font>

208
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:57,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to make up for it.</font>

209
00:09:59,120 --> 00:10:01,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thanks, Mobai, for the meat I like.</font>

210
00:10:03,360 --> 00:10:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's so delicious.</font>

211
00:10:04,600 --> 00:10:06,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai, you've lost weight too.</font>

212
00:10:06,920 --> 00:10:08,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me give Mobai a piece of meat.</font>

213
00:10:08,520 --> 00:10:09,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's my favorite.</font>

214
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Alright.</font>

215
00:10:11,440 --> 00:10:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it good?</font>

216
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's good.</font>

217
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:15,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why am I dining with them?</font>

218
00:10:20,240 --> 00:10:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

219
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is the gift list</font>

220
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from Prime Minister Li.</font>

221
00:10:24,040 --> 00:10:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">More gifts coming in.</font>

222
00:10:26,040 --> 00:10:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai.</font>

223
00:10:27,280 --> 00:10:29,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since the Great Emperor
made you Crown Prince,</font>

224
00:10:29,920 --> 00:10:31,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the gifts keep pouring in daily.</font>

225
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Return them as usual.</font>

226
00:10:33,920 --> 00:10:35,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And thank Prime Minister Li
for his kindness.</font>

227
00:10:35,800 --> 00:10:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

228
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a shame
to send back such fine gifts.</font>

229
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Gifts oblige you; favors tie your hands.</font>

230
00:10:44,240 --> 00:10:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I dare not accept</font>

231
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">others' flattery so freely</font>

232
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">except for you.</font>

233
00:10:52,160 --> 00:10:52,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've made up my mind.</font>

234
00:10:53,600 --> 00:10:54,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll head back to Beiyuan tomorrow.</font>

235
00:10:55,480 --> 00:10:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

236
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty has summoned you back?</font>

237
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would I stay here?</font>

238
00:10:59,200 --> 00:11:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm sick of watching you</font>

239
00:11:00,120 --> 00:11:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">being lovey-dovey every day.</font>

240
00:11:02,400 --> 00:11:04,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides, I've long been away
on escort duty.</font>

241
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I should return to report as well.</font>

242
00:11:06,560 --> 00:11:07,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you forget</font>

243
00:11:07,800 --> 00:11:08,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that I'm the Vice Minister</font>

244
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

245
00:11:10,840 --> 00:11:12,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Court can't do without me.</font>

246
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still have my 300 men.</font>

247
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll send someone
to escort you back.</font>

248
00:11:15,560 --> 00:11:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need.</font>

249
00:11:16,520 --> 00:11:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just have a fast horse ready for me.</font>

250
00:11:18,320 --> 00:11:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can ride back in no time.</font>

251
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai,</font>

252
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">don't you bully my sister.</font>

253
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is so good.</font>

254
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying, what's wrong?</font>

255
00:11:32,560 --> 00:11:33,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it?</font>

256
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:36,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qin Mobai,</font>

257
00:11:38,240 --> 00:11:39,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she isn't with child, is she?</font>

258
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
the Crown Princess isn't pregnant.</font>

259
00:12:09,520 --> 00:12:11,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She simply ate too fast
and upset her stomach.</font>

260
00:12:11,560 --> 00:12:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll prescribe a few remedies
for her to rest.</font>

261
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Physician,</font>

262
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:15,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you...</font>

263
00:12:15,640 --> 00:12:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could you check once more?</font>

264
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:20,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her stomach is indeed upset.</font>

265
00:12:23,240 --> 00:12:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just too happy.</font>

266
00:12:28,360 --> 00:12:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at you.</font>

267
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A few months later]</font>

268
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Fourth Prince was named Crown Prince</font>

269
00:12:37,520 --> 00:12:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">several months ago.</font>

270
00:12:39,120 --> 00:12:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are his sister and brother-in-law</font>

271
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">still living in the residence?</font>

272
00:12:42,400 --> 00:12:43,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He fears his sister will be mistreated.</font>

273
00:12:44,040 --> 00:12:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I heard</font>

274
00:12:44,960 --> 00:12:46,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that his brother-in-law
is not only handsome</font>

275
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but was once a general.</font>

276
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nonsense.</font>

277
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why would a general live</font>

278
00:12:50,520 --> 00:12:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">at his brother-in-law's house?</font>

279
00:12:51,760 --> 00:12:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's more like a kept man.</font>

280
00:12:56,280 --> 00:12:58,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey, after all this waiting,</font>

281
00:12:58,880 --> 00:13:00,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what do you really want to eat?</font>

282
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear,</font>

283
00:13:02,120 --> 00:13:03,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone just called me a kept man.</font>

284
00:13:04,760 --> 00:13:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you're still thinking about food?</font>

285
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Well, they weren't exactly wrong.</font>

286
00:13:10,160 --> 00:13:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you feeling defiant?</font>

287
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't dare.</font>

288
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everything I have is yours.</font>

289
00:13:14,880 --> 00:13:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your word is my command.</font>

290
00:13:17,880 --> 00:13:18,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From now on,</font>

291
00:13:18,920 --> 00:13:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be relying on your support.</font>

292
00:13:21,640 --> 00:13:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then,</font>

293
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want noodles.</font>

294
00:13:24,240 --> 00:13:24,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Noodles?</font>

295
00:13:25,920 --> 00:13:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you didn't eat noodles.</font>

296
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not for me.</font>

297
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:31,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's for the little one.</font>

298
00:13:33,800 --> 00:13:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So young,</font>

299
00:13:35,200 --> 00:13:36,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and already throwing his weight around.</font>

300
00:13:37,320 --> 00:13:38,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't say that.</font>

301
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They'll be heartbroken.</font>

302
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you call yourself a coroner.</font>

303
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:44,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their ears haven't even grown in yet.</font>

304
00:13:45,600 --> 00:13:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What could they possibly hear?</font>

305
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just don't like them.</font>

306
00:13:49,040 --> 00:13:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, fine.</font>

307
00:13:51,400 --> 00:13:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Waiter, two bowls of plain noodles.</font>

308
00:13:53,800 --> 00:13:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Coming right up.</font>

309
00:13:55,640 --> 00:13:57,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you heard
about that other strange affair?</font>

310
00:13:57,880 --> 00:13:59,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wang, west of the city.</font>

311
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He actually dug up his daughter</font>

312
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who was buried five years ago.</font>

313
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's had every coroner
examine her remains.</font>

314
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:06,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think he's up to?</font>

315
00:14:07,560 --> 00:14:08,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have a relative.</font>

316
00:14:08,560 --> 00:14:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He lives right next door to him.</font>

317
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He says Wang</font>

318
00:14:11,160 --> 00:14:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">heard a rumor from somewhere.</font>

319
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:14,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He thinks his daughter
didn't die of illness.</font>

320
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He believes it was murder.</font>

321
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But many coroners have examined it.</font>

322
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None could find anything unusual.</font>

323
00:14:22,680 --> 00:14:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are with child now.</font>

324
00:14:24,600 --> 00:14:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't dwell on such dreadful matters.</font>

325
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if it frightens the baby?</font>

326
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You said yourself</font>

327
00:14:29,160 --> 00:14:31,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that they have no eyes or ears yet.</font>

328
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely not.</font>

329
00:14:36,920 --> 00:14:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said no, and that's final.</font>

330
00:14:51,200 --> 00:14:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why is it always these two dishes?</font>

331
00:14:52,560 --> 00:14:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I won't eat. Take it away.</font>

332
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
the Crown Prince ordered:</font>

333
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I don't see you finish this,</font>

334
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:57,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am not permitted to leave.</font>

335
00:14:57,520 --> 00:14:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have the kitchen change the menu.</font>

336
00:15:00,080 --> 00:15:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would like to have</font>

337
00:15:01,240 --> 00:15:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sweet and sour fish
and crystal pork knuckle.</font>

338
00:15:03,160 --> 00:15:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
the Imperial Physician said</font>

339
00:15:04,640 --> 00:15:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that for the sake of your stomach,</font>

340
00:15:05,560 --> 00:15:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you may only eat bland foods.</font>

341
00:15:08,320 --> 00:15:10,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is discriminating against the food.</font>

342
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:12,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine
if the kitchen doesn't make it.</font>

343
00:15:13,160 --> 00:15:14,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll just make it myself.</font>

344
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:15,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

345
00:15:16,120 --> 00:15:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

346
00:15:17,080 --> 00:15:17,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're breaking the rules.</font>

347
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up quickly.</font>

348
00:15:20,040 --> 00:15:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Playing hurt won't work on me.</font>

349
00:15:22,320 --> 00:15:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I dare not defy the Imperial Physician.</font>

350
00:15:24,600 --> 00:15:26,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you throw up or get diarrhea again,</font>

351
00:15:26,120 --> 00:15:27,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Crown Prince will punish me.</font>

352
00:15:27,560 --> 00:15:29,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's so busy
that he has no time even for me.</font>

353
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How would he have time to punish you?</font>

354
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't get up right now,</font>

355
00:15:32,760 --> 00:15:33,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll have to punish you myself.</font>

356
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:34,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get up now.</font>

357
00:15:40,000 --> 00:15:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine, you win.</font>

358
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Happy now?</font>

359
00:15:41,640 --> 00:15:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll eat.</font>

360
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can rise now.</font>

361
00:15:59,320 --> 00:15:59,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey,</font>

362
