363
00:16:03,520 --> 00:16:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you have nothing else to do,</font>

364
00:16:05,160 --> 00:16:06,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you could go play chess with my brother.</font>

365
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:09,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In fact, for the rest of my life,</font>

366
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you won't be out of my sight.</font>

367
00:16:11,640 --> 00:16:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, don't try to send me away.</font>

368
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to use the privy.</font>

369
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll go with you.</font>

370
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

371
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:26,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

372
00:16:27,350 --> 00:16:28,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

373
00:16:29,020 --> 00:16:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

374
00:16:32,940 --> 00:16:37,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

375
00:16:37,620 --> 00:16:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
